    "chunk_size_bytes": 1257,
    "chunk_text": "Cristiano Ronaldo marries long-time partner Georgina Rodr\u00edguez\n\nBBC - Football superstar Cristiano Ronaldo has married his longtime partner - model and influencer Georgina Rodr\u00edguez - in a civil ceremony in Portugal.\n\nThe Portuguese striker posted an image on his Instagram account showing two hands - presumed to be his on top of his wife's - both wearing wedding rings.\n\nCalling it the wedding of the year, Portuguese media say the couple tied the knot on 11 August in the coastal town of Cascais near Lisbon - and that their five children attended.\n\nThe Instagram entry had more than 3m likes within 30 minutes of being posted.\n\nThe couple have been together for 10 years, after they met at a Gucci shop in Madrid where Rodr\u00edguez was working. He was playing at the Spanish club Real Madrid at the time.\n\nAt the time, Rodr\u00edguez posted a picture of a large ring, writing \"Yes I do. In this and in all my lives\" in her native Spanish.\n\nRonaldo has scored nearly 1,000 goals in a career in which he has played for Lisbon-based Sporting, Manchester United, Real Madrid, Juventus, Al Nassr in Saudi Arabia and Portugal.\n\nHe recently played in his sixth World Cup, a record for appearances in the men's finals which he shares with Lionel Messi of Argentina."
