    "chunk_text": "Government trying to disable Judiciary and create dictatorship: Sajith\n\nColombo, Aug. 12 (Daily Mirror) - The Government is out to disable the Judiciary and create a dictatorship, Opposition Leader Sajith Premadasa said today.\n\nSpeaking at a gathering in Galle, the Opposition Leader said the 22nd Amendment to the Constitution would weaken the Judiciary.\n\n\u201cThe Government is trying to disable the Judiciary and then create a dictatorship,\u201d he said."
